{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1409339-fire-dust-weapons-cost-in-2e","id":1409339,"title":"Fire Dust Weapons, Cost in 2e","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-08-20T06:36:17-07:00","id":1409339,"title":"Fire Dust Weapons, Cost in 2e","content":"Our campaign has taken off in the South of Creation, the land of fire dust. I found a handful of dust costs 1 dor of resources, but is it published anywhere about larger quantities? Where?<br /> <br /> Is there e iisting of all the scattered fire dust weapons I can look up, or a list of the Exalted 2e books that contain them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3814-g3taso","name":"g3taso","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3814_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"348"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-20T11:43:51-07:00","id":1409403,"title":"","content":"Isn\u2019t going up a resource dot \u201cmultiply base quantity by a lot\u201d? My guess would be 2 dots = enough for one person for a while, 3 dots would supply your bandit gang, 4 dots is somewhere around \u201cLegion of Firey Death\u201d<br /> <br /> Course in the derper South, there is the option of harvesting your own. Was it Compass: Wyld that had a wyld zone that spontaneously generated firedust?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2678-spoonr","name":"SpoonR","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2678_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"